Place TorchScript segmentation models here.

Included models:

- `lraspp_torchscript-traced_float32_512_512.pt`: default model used by fresh installs.
- `lraspp_quantized_float32_512_512.pt`: smaller CPU-oriented alternative.
- `deeplab_torchscript-traced_float32_512_512.pt`
- `deeplab_torchscript-scripted_float32_512_512.pt`

The session settings dialog seeds `Model path` from the default LR-ASPP model above.
